window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-e8a44d8693c261b7"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"workspace-analytics\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">工作区分析</h1> <blockquote> <p>如需完整的文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 后添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p>ChatGPT 工作区分析适用于宏观了解整个工作区的采用情况；Codex 分析适用于以 Codex 为重点的报告。Analytics API 用于通过程序生成汇总数据，Compliance API 用于获取可审计记录。</p> <p>这些报告界面不会授予产品访问权限，也不会设置运行时策略。管理边界请参阅<a href=\"#/article/a-a292ca32ae057ed8\">角色与工作区权限</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"choose-a-reporting-surface\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">选择报告界面</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>界面</th> <th>用途</th> <th>规范来源</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td>ChatGPT 工作区分析</td> <td>以交互方式查看整个工作区的采用与参与情况</td> <td><a href=\"https://help.openai.com/en/articles/10875114\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">工作区分析帮助中心指南（需联网）</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Codex 分析</td> <td>以交互方式查看 Codex 采用情况与活动</td> <td>已登录的 <a href=\"https://admin.openai.com/analytics/codex\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Codex 分析控制面板（需联网）</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Analytics API</td> <td>以程序方式获取 Codex 汇总报告</td> <td><a href=\"https://chatgpt.com/public/admin/api-reference#tag/Codex%20Enterprise%20Analytics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Codex Analytics API 参考（需联网）</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Compliance API</td> <td>用于审计、安全、法律及调查的记录</td> <td><a href=\"https://chatgpt.com/public/admin/api-reference\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Admin API 参考（需联网）</a></td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><a id=\"review-chatgpt-workspace-analytics\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"chatgpt\">查看 ChatGPT 工作区分析</h2> <p>ChatGPT 工作区分析会以交互方式展示受支持工作区功能的采用与参与情况。可用性、角色、控制面板版块、数据更新时效、隐私行为及导出格式都可能变化。当前覆盖范围和操作步骤请以<a href=\"https://help.openai.com/en/articles/10875114\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ChatGPT Enterprise 与 Edu 的工作区分析（需联网）</a>为准。</p> <p>请将下载的报告视为可识别组织的数据。应遵守组织的访问、存储和保留策略，不要想当然地认为导出的数据具有与汇总控制面板相同的隐私属性。</p> <p><a id=\"review-codex-analytics\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"codex\">查看 Codex 分析</h2> <p>已登录的 <a href=\"https://admin.openai.com/analytics/codex\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Codex 分析控制面板（需联网）</a>侧重 Codex 报告。它适合交互式探索，不是稳定的架构或字段契约。控制面板的分类、字段、筛选器和导出格式可能独立于本页发生变化。</p> <p>Insights 控制面板的操作说明请参阅<a href=\"#/article/a-474523711974414a\">用量洞察</a>。浏览用例和任务，将活动与消耗量、覆盖范围进行比较，并打开某个分类查看详情。</p> <p>如需自动化报告，请使用 <a href=\"#/article/a-88b1ced5fbccd242\">Analytics API</a>，并遵循其 API 参考。如需可审计记录，请使用 <a href=\"#/article/a-9d54fab7ad7294d0\">Compliance API</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"interpret-reporting-data\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">解读报告数据</h2> <p>请牢记以下边界：</p> <ul> <li>ChatGPT 工作区分析与 Codex 分析覆盖的产品范围不同。</li> <li>汇总分析与审计记录用途不同，且各自有独立的规范。</li> <li>分析数据描述的是活动，不会授予访问权限或更改运行时权限。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-48de7f90f27343f8\">ChatGPT 用量上限与支出控制</a>属于另一个受套餐影响的工作区控制边界。</li> </ul>","en":"<h1 id=\"workspace-analytics\">Workspace analytics</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <p>Use ChatGPT workspace analytics for broad workspace adoption. Use Codex analytics for Codex-focused reporting. Use the Analytics API for programmatic aggregates and the Compliance API for auditable records.</p> <p>These reporting surfaces don't grant product access or set runtime policy. See <a href=\"#/article/a-a292ca32ae057ed8\">Roles and workspace permissions</a> for the administration boundaries.</p> <h2 id=\"choose-a-reporting-surface\">Choose a reporting surface</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Surface</th> <th>Use it for</th> <th>Contract owner</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td>ChatGPT workspace analytics</td> <td>Interactive, workspace-wide adoption and engagement reporting</td> <td><a href=\"https://help.openai.com/en/articles/10875114\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Workspace analytics Help Center guidance (online)</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Codex analytics</td> <td>Interactive reporting focused on Codex adoption and activity</td> <td>The authenticated <a href=\"https://admin.openai.com/analytics/codex\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Codex analytics dashboard (online)</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Analytics API</td> <td>Programmatic, aggregated Codex reporting</td> <td>The <a href=\"https://chatgpt.com/public/admin/api-reference#tag/Codex%20Enterprise%20Analytics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Codex Analytics API reference (online)</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Compliance API</td> <td>Audit, security, legal, and investigation records</td> <td>The <a href=\"https://chatgpt.com/public/admin/api-reference\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Admin API reference (online)</a></td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <h2 id=\"review-chatgpt-workspace-analytics\">Review ChatGPT workspace analytics</h2> <p>ChatGPT workspace analytics provides an interactive view of adoption and engagement across supported workspace features. Availability, roles, dashboard sections, freshness, privacy behavior, and export formats can change. Use <a href=\"https://help.openai.com/en/articles/10875114\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Workspace analytics for ChatGPT Enterprise and Edu (online)</a> for current coverage and procedures.</p> <p>Treat downloaded reports as identifiable organizational data. Apply the organization's access, storage, and retention policy instead of assuming that an export has the same privacy characteristics as an aggregated dashboard.</p> <h2 id=\"review-codex-analytics\">Review Codex analytics</h2> <p>The authenticated <a href=\"https://admin.openai.com/analytics/codex\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Codex analytics dashboard (online)</a> focuses on Codex reporting. Use it for interactive exploration, not as a stable schema contract. Dashboard categories, fields, filters, and export formats can change independently of this page.</p> <p>For a walkthrough of the Insights dashboard, see <a href=\"#/article/a-474523711974414a\">Usage Insights</a>. Explore Use cases and Tasks, compare activity with consumption and reach, and open a category to understand its details.</p> <p>For automated reporting, use the <a href=\"#/article/a-88b1ced5fbccd242\">Analytics API</a> and follow its API reference. For auditable records, use the <a href=\"#/article/a-9d54fab7ad7294d0\">Compliance API</a>.</p> <h2 id=\"interpret-reporting-data\">Interpret reporting data</h2> <p>Keep these boundaries in mind:</p> <ul> <li>ChatGPT workspace analytics and Codex analytics cover different product scopes.</li> <li>Aggregated analytics and audit records serve different purposes and have separate contracts.</li> <li>Analytics describes activity; it doesn't grant access or change runtime permissions.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-48de7f90f27343f8\">ChatGPT usage limits and spend controls</a> are a separate, plan-dependent workspace boundary.</li> </ul>"};
